@*
    jQuery is loaded here rather than in the layout because this partial is the only thing
    that needs it — the rest of the site is server-rendered with one small countdown script.
    It was missing entirely, so both forms shipped with client-side validation that threw on
    load and never ran. The localised messages still arrived, but only after a round trip.
*@
<script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/dist/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>
